# Check text out with LF everywhere. With core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows
# default) every shipped skill/manifest/spec lands as CRLF, and the daemon's
# frontmatter and YAML readers (which expect \n) misread them on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only launchers keep CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
